      "typeVersion": 1,
      "credentials": {
        "httpBasicAuth": {
          "id": "2DilsoCE2gw7sEA8",
          "name": "John Doe"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "agent": "sqlAgent",
        "dataSource": "sqlite",
        "options": {
          "prefixPrompt": "You are an SQL agent. Generate a syntactically correct {dialect} query based on the user's question. Run the query and return the results.\n\n### Guidelines:\n1. **Query**:\n    - Generate a correct SQL query.\n    - Use LIMIT to restrict results to {top_k}, unless specified.\n    - Order results by a relevant column.\n    - Select only relevant columns.\n\n2. **Execution**:\n    - Double-check the query before running.\n    - Rewrite and retry if there is an error.\n\n3. **Restrictions**:\n    - No DML statements (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, DROP).\n    - Use only provided tools and their information.\n\n4. **Response**:\n    - If the question is unrelated to the database, reply with \"I don't know.\"\n\n### Example:\n- **Input**: \"Show the top 5 employees with the highest salaries.\"\n- **Query**: \n    ```sql\n    SELECT employee_name, salary\n    FROM employees\n    ORDER BY salary DESC\n    LIMIT 5;\n    ```\n\n- Ensure the query matches the {dialect}.\n- Replace {top_k} with the appropriate number.\n",
          "suffixPrompt": "Begin!\nChat History:\n{chatHistory}\n\nQuestion: {input}\nThought: I should look at the tables in the database to see what I can query.\n{agent_scratchpad}"
        }
